              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mare34"
            },
            "reviewBody": "i cheated by using 8oz.bottle of Italian dressing as a base. \nused 1/4 cup mayo (not eggs) and sugar just enough to take out the bitterness a little less than a 1/5 cup and no hot sauce.For creamer\ndressing use extra mayo,the better the brand the better the dressing will taste.same with base dressing.",
            "datePublished": "2013-11-18T10:42:34.917Z"
          },
          {
