            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jeeplette"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was one of 3 caesar dressings we tried today and we did not care for this one at all. It was too sweet and the hot pepper sauce was not a good addition for us...we used Frank's Redhot Sauce since we don't care for Tabasco (and we like spicy things). \n\nWe ended up adding 2-3 anchovy filets, a bit more red wine vinegar, and some black pepper. It was edible but we will not be making this one again.",
            "datePublished": "2012-07-05T19:22:53.387Z"
          },
